# PakCompress - no real keys here. Copy to .env.local only when you set up paid checkout.
# Do not put any secret in frontend code. Paddle or Lemon Squeezy keys stay server side only.
# Example placeholders only:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://pakcompress.example.com
# PADDLE_VENDOR_ID=
# PADDLE_API_KEY=
# LEMON_SQUEEZY_API_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_CLIENT_TOKEN=
